{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ86Ve5FHJmVbUMkT5bK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Palantir's 3-year revenue CAGR is about 22.9%**, measured from fiscal 2021 to fiscal 2024. FY2024 is the latest full fiscal year reported in a filing made on or before 16 May 2025.\n\n| Fiscal year (ends 31 Dec) | Revenue |\n|---|---|\n| FY2021 (start year) | $1,541,889,000 |\n| FY2022 | $1,905,871,000 |\n| FY2023 | $2,225,012,000 |\n| FY2024 (end year) | $2,865,507,000 |\n\n**Calculation:**\nCAGR = (2,865,507,000 / 1,541,889,000)^(1/3) − 1 = (1.8584)^(1/3) − 1 ≈ **22.9%**\n\nThe revenue figures are Palantir's XBRL tag RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax. The data also included a 10-K filed in February 2026 with FY2025 figures. I left it out because it is dated after 16 May 2025.\n\n**Sources**\n- Form 10-K for FY2024, filed 2025-02-18, accession 0001321655-25-000022 (FY2024, FY2023 and FY2022 revenue)\n- Form 10-K for FY2023, filed 2024-02-20, accession 0001321655-24-000022 (FY2021 revenue, same value as originally reported)\n- Form 10-K for FY2021, filed 2022-02-24, accession 0001193125-22-050913 (FY2021 revenue as originally reported)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1831,"cache_read_input_tokens":7730,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1831},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e66204e4-f249-4297-ad7f-2600f97730f3","uuid":"33de0fdc-b217-4aac-bbb3-27e7090dd723","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:16:44.033Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ86VNT83vtM85Qd7rq8"}
